asciicam (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Add speaker-dependent speech recognition: --listen reads audio from a
    file, fifo or stdin and prints recognised words and phrases as lines,
    or as live captions during a --call.
  * Add --voice-enroll, --voice-list, --voice-forget and --voice to teach
    and manage the words it knows.

